  "city_listings_note": "Homes and premises in the furnished cities (D-127): a share of each kind of building is let or sold, the rest are lived and worked in by the city's people. A unit's geometry comes from the building's own sidecar (city_buildings/<id>.json, units); its terms come from the template here for that building, at the city's price factor. Which buildings of a kind are to let is a fixed hash of the world seed and the building, so every player sees the same street. scripts/economy_model.py checks these templates as it checks the listings above.",
